# Verification (overview v3.1)

The **✓ verified** tick is earned, never assumed. Do not show it until required checks complete.

## Sign-up fields

- Name; profile photo optional but encouraged
- Account type: **professional** or **university student**
- Professional: job title, company, industry
- Student: university + field of study
- Location: city, country
- Email and phone collected; visibility is independent (see privacy rule)

## Required checks

- **Professionals:** work-email OTP + personal-email verification + phone verification
- **Students:** personal email + university email
- Tick only after identity, contact, and **employment or university** checks complete

```ts
// ❌ BAD — show verified tick after email signup alone
profile.verified = Boolean(user.email)

// ✅ GOOD — tick after the account-type checklist is complete
profile.verified = checksComplete(user.accountType, user.verifications)
```

Do not treat a marketing demo checkmark as a live verified state.
